Error [E0623]: `use "helper"` imports a file, but this file belongs to a package
  --> tests/ui/package_file_import/run.jet:3:5
    |
  3 | use "helper"
    |     ^^^^^^^^
 Why: The files of one package share one namespace, so they reach each other's names without imports; only loose files import files by path.
 Fix: Remove the import and use the names directly, or import another package with `use <package>.[names]`.
